flowchart TD
    A([Tool call from immutable catalog]) --> B{Known tool and valid schema?}
    B -->|No| X[Typed denied or invalid result]
    B -->|Yes| C[Normalize arguments and target paths]
    C --> D{Permission decision}
    D -->|Deny| X
    D -->|Ask| E{Explicit approval granted?}
    E -->|No| X
    E -->|Yes| F{Security validators pass?}
    D -->|Allow| F
    F -->|No| X
    F -->|Yes| G{Ownership and workspace scope pass?}
    G -->|No| X
    G -->|Yes| H{Required isolation is ready?}
    H -->|No| X
    H -->|Yes| I{Concurrency safe?}
    I -->|Yes| J[Bounded parallel queue]
    I -->|No| K[Serial queue]
    J --> L[Bind final execution identity and proof]
    K --> L
    L --> S{Durable journal configured?}
    S -->|No| T[Emit start and execute inside selected isolation]
    S -->|Yes| U[Persist synchronous digest-only marker]
    U --> V{Exact marker CAS succeeds?}
    V -->|No| X
    V -->|Yes| T
    T --> M{Execution succeeds?}
    M -->|Yes| N[Post-hook and success evidence]
    M -->|No| O{Rollback available?}
    O -->|Yes| P[Rollback mutation]
    O -->|No| Q[Post-hook and error evidence]
    P --> Q
    X --> Q
    N --> R([Return typed result])
    Q --> R
